  "title": "Problems with not having Aadhaar",
  "description": "Meghavath Sathish and Nenavath Mohan, Lambadi speakers from Telangana, India, talk about Aadhaar, India's digital ID, and their community's life. Subhashish Panigrahi, a Baleswari Odia speaker, interviewed them in Hyderabad, Telangana, on 4 September 2019 for his documentary MarginalizedAadhaar. Panigrahi subtitled the interview in Hindi on location from a word-for-word translation by Meghavath and Nenavath. He later edited the footage, some of which was used in the film, translated the subtitles into English and published them under the OpenSpeaks Archives project in 2026.",
